<mxCell id="t416" value="&lt;b&gt;Answer:&lt;/b&gt; A semaphore matches “at most three”. Releasing a permit you never acquired raises the count and lets a fourth firing in." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="332" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
